Defect F2 (chamfer): BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer crashes the process at a corner of
three chamfered edges whose corner plane does not cut the end face in one line.

Defect id: F2 (pySMESH phase 4, finding F2, brief amendment 4).

Symptom: BRepPrimAPI_MakeSphere(1.0, 1.5 * pi), a sphere cut to a wedge of 1.5 pi;
a chamfer of distance 0.01 on its three edges that are not degenerated: the two
meridian arcs and the axis line, which meet at each pole. Build() reads address
0x18 and the process ends with an access violation. The same chamfer builds on a
wedge of pi / 2, and any two of the three edges build.

Root cause: ChFi3d_ChBuilder::PerformThreeCorner(), planar corner that is not a
triangle (c1plan and not c1triangle). The curve where the corner plane cuts
face[pivot], gcface, is set only when GeomInt_IntSS is done and returns exactly
one line (ChFi3d_ChBuilder_C3.cxx:750-771 at V8_0_1). On the reflex wedge
face[pivot] is the sphere, and GeomInt_IntSS returns the circle where the corner
plane cuts it as two arcs, split at the sphere's seam; the corner's two end
points lie one on each arc (measured, at both poles). gcface stays a null
handle, and lines 776-778 call ChFiKPart_IndexCurveInDS(gcface, ...) and
gcface->FirstParameter() through it.

Change: a null gcface after the intersection throws StdFail_NotDone, as the
other failed intersections of this function do (lines 625-700).
ChFi3d_Builder::Compute() catches the failure of one vertex and lists the vertex
as bad (ChFi3d_Builder.cxx:306-318), so the chamfer reports not done: IsDone()
false, the vertex among the faulty vertices. Kind: a clean failure, not a
computed corner. Joining the two arcs would need a choice of arc and of
orientation on a periodic circle that no branch of this function makes, and the
corner would then run through the sphere's degenerated pole; that result has no
independent check here. Only an input that dereferenced the null handle reaches
the throw.

Files and functions changed:
  src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/ChFi3d/ChFi3d_ChBuilder_C3.cxx
    ChFi3d_ChBuilder::PerformThreeCorner(), planar corner branch.

Applies to: OCCT V8_0_1 (b8f597c677811d1f9f4d8a97f5ae2825c0353a42), after 0001.

